# Seed-assisted LJ crystallization, reduced units. The 32 gold particles are
# an immobile crystalline template, not spontaneous homogeneous nucleation.
# The other 224 particles cool and reorganize under actual LJ forces.
#/atom 1 0.48 #79D7FA
#/atom 2 0.48 #F6C86B
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data seed-liquid.data nocoeff
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
pair_modify shift yes
neighbor 0.5 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
group template type 2
group mobile type 1
velocity template set 0 0 0
fix hold template setforce 0 0 0
fix integrate mobile nve
variable bath equal ternary(step<500,1.6,ternary(step<4500,1.6-1.45*(step-500.0)/4000.0,0.15))
fix thermal mobile langevin v_bath 0.15 0.2 82347 zero yes
timestep 0.004
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step atoms temp pe ke etotal
run 0
